      "reason": "minecraft-data 1.21.11 writes one display after the modifier list. Vanilla 1.21.11 ItemAttributeModifiers.STREAM_CODEC is list(Entry.STREAM_CODEC) and Entry is attribute, modifier, slot and display, so every entry carries its own display, exactly as minecraft-data 1.21.6-1.21.9 and 26.1 describe it.",
